OL,3,AMcDonald's sex abuse: 'They were       
OL,4,Awaiting for the younger girls to turn  
OL,5,A18'                                    
OL,7,FHope is one of hundreds of workers     
OL,8,Fbringing a discrimination claim against
OL,9,FMcDonald's. This week, a judge ruled   
OL,10,Fagainst McDonald's attempt to have     
OL,11,Ftheir claims struck out, a move that   
OL,12,FHope welcomed.                         
OL,14,FMcDonald's said: "Ensuring a safe,     
OL,15,Frespectful and inclusive working       
OL,16,Fenvironment across our restaurants and 
OL,17,Foffices remains a fundamental          
OL,18,Fpriority."                             
